function preferenceControls(p){const groups=[['辅导与表达',['guidance','hint','length']],['错题与关联',['analysis','summary','association']],['复习与练习',['frequency','difficulty']]];return `<input type="hidden" name="preference_preset" value="${esc(p.preset)}"><div class="preference-presets"><div class="row"><h3>学习模式</h3><span id="preference-mode" class="badge neutral">${esc(presetLabels[p.preset]||p.preset)}</span></div><div class="preset-row" role="group" aria-label="学习模式预设">${['light','standard','deep'].map(k=>`<button type="button" data-preset="${k}" aria-pressed="${p.preset===k}" class="preset ${p.preset===k?'selected':''}">${presetLabels[k]}</button>`).join('')}</div><p class="help">预设会填入下方八项设置；修改单项后转为自定义，保存后生效。</p></div>${groups.map(([title,keys])=>`<fieldset class="preference-group"><legend>${title}</legend>${preferenceFields.filter(([key])=>keys.includes(key)).map(([key,label,values])=>select(label,key,values.map((v,i)=>option(String(i),v,String(p[key]??1))).join(''))).join('')}</fieldset>`).join('')}`;}
async function mountPreferences(epoch,taskId){const path='/api/preferences?user_id=local'+(taskId?'&task_id='+encodeURIComponent(taskId):'');let p=await api(path);p=p.effective||p.preferences||p;if(epoch!==state.epoch)return;
  const holder=document.getElementById(taskId?'task-preferences':'global-preferences');if(!holder)return;const inherited=!!p.inherited;holder.innerHTML=`<h2>${taskId?'本题学习偏好':'AI 学习偏好'}</h2><p id="preference-scope" class="scope-note"><span class="badge neutral">${taskId?'本题范围':'全局范围'}</span> ${taskId?(inherited?'当前继承全局偏好；保存后仅覆盖本题。':'本题已有独立覆盖；全局设置保持不变。'):'用于未设置本题覆盖的学习任务，保存到本机数据库。'}</p><form id="${taskId?'task-preferences-form':'preferences-form'}" data-draft>${preferenceControls(p)}<div class="preference-save"><p id="preference-save-state" class="save-state" role="status" aria-live="polite">已保存 · ${taskId?(inherited?'使用全局偏好':'使用本题覆盖'):'刷新后仍会保留'}</p><div class="actions"><button id="${taskId?'save-task-preferences':'save-preferences'}" type="submit" class="primary">保存${taskId?'本题':'全局'}偏好</button><button id="${taskId?'reset-task-preferences':'reset-preferences'}" type="button">${taskId?'恢复全局设置':'恢复默认'}</button></div></div></form><p class="help preference-footnote">学习偏好为教学调用提供上下文。AI 是否启用由 AI 配置单独控制，模拟辅导会明确标识。</p>`;
  const form=holder.querySelector('form');let preset=p.preset;const saveState=form.querySelector('#preference-save-state');const updateSaveState=()=>{const isDirty=dirtyForm(form);saveState.className='save-state'+(isDirty?' is-dirty':'');saveState.textContent=isDirty?'有未保存修改 · 点击保存后生效':'已保存 · 当前设置已保留';};
  const syncMode=()=>{form.elements.preference_preset.value=preset;form.querySelector('#preference-mode').textContent=presetLabels[preset]||preset;form.querySelectorAll('[data-preset]').forEach(b=>{const selected=b.dataset.preset===preset;b.classList.toggle('selected',selected);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(selected));});};
  form.querySelectorAll('select').forEach(n=>n.addEventListener('change',()=>{preset='custom';syncMode();updateSaveState();}));
  form.querySelectorAll('[data-preset]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{preset=b.dataset.preset;const n={light:0,standard:1,deep:2}[preset];preferenceFields.forEach(([key])=>form.elements.namedItem(key).value=String(preset==='standard'&&key==='difficulty'?0:n));syncMode();updateSaveState();form.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));}));
  form.addEventListener('input',updateSaveState);form.addEventListener('change',updateSaveState);
  bindForm(form.id,async(form,data)=>{const snapshot=serialize(form);saveState.textContent='正在保存…';saveState.className='save-state';try{await api(path,'PUT',preset==='custom'?{preset,...Object.fromEntries(preferenceFields.map(([key])=>[key,Number(data.get(key))]))}:{preset});saved(form,snapshot);saveState.className='save-state'+(dirtyForm(form)?' is-dirty':' is-saved');saveState.textContent=dirtyForm(form)?'已保存提交时的设置 · 仍有新的未保存修改':'已保存 · '+when(new Date().toISOString());if(taskId)holder.querySelector('#preference-scope').innerHTML='<span class="badge neutral">本题范围</span> 本题已有独立覆盖；全局设置保持不变。';notify('学习偏好已保存。');}catch(error){saveState.className='save-state error-text';saveState.textContent='保存未成功 · '+error.message;throw error;}});
  form.querySelector('button[id^=reset-]').addEventListener('click',()=>action(form,async()=>{await api('/api/preferences/reset?user_id=local'+(taskId?'&task_id='+encodeURIComponent(taskId):''),'POST');await mountPreferences(epoch,taskId);notify(taskId?'本题已恢复使用全局偏好。':'默认学习偏好已恢复。');}));saved(form);
}
function renderSubmissions(){const box=document.getElementById('submission-list');if(!box)return;const items=(state.task.submissions||[]).slice().reverse();const row=s=>`<article class="submission"><div class="row wrap-mobile"><strong>${(s.mode||s.kind)==='samples'?'公开样例':'正式测试'} · ${esc(statusName(s.status))}</strong><span class="badge ${s.version_id!==state.task.current_version_id?'neutral':s.status==='passed'?'success':'warn'}">${esc(vlabel(s.version_id))}${s.version_id!==state.task.current_version_id?' · 历史版本':''}</span></div><p class="help">${Number(s.passed||0)} / ${Number(s.total||0)} 项一致 · ${when(s.created_at)}</p><details class="record-details"><summary>测试与执行证据</summary><p class="help mono">提交 ${esc(s.id)}</p>${(s.cases||[]).map(c=>`<p class="tiny mono">${esc(c.case_id||c.id)} · ${esc(statusName(c.status))} · ${c.matches_expected===true?'一致':c.matches_expected===false?'不一致':'未完成比较'}<br>执行证据 ${esc(c.evidence_id||'尚无')}</p>`).join('')}<p class="help">隐藏测试只显示状态和证据标识，不展示输入、预期或实际输出。</p></details></article>`;box.innerHTML=items.length?row(items[0])+(items.length>1?`<details class="submission-history"><summary>更早的测试记录 · ${items.length-1} 条</summary>${items.slice(1).map(row).join('')}</details>`:''):empty('还没有样例或正式测试记录。保存代码后开始。');}
function boundErrorEvidence(err){const evidence=(state.task.evidence||[]).find(e=>e.id===err.evidence_id);if(!err.evidence_id)return '<p class="help">未绑定执行证据；当前内容来自手工记录。</p>';if(!evidence)return `<p class="status-note warn">绑定的执行证据暂不可用，请核对原记录。${esc(err.evidence_id)}</p>`;const result=evidence.result||{};if(result.hidden)return `<details class="record-details error-evidence"><summary>查看执行证据 · ${esc(statusName(result.status))}</summary><p class="help">正式测试案例内容保密，仅展示执行状态与比较结论。</p><p class="help">期望比较：${result.matches_expected===true?'一致':result.matches_expected===false?'不一致':'未完成比较'} · ${when(evidence.created_at)}</p><p class="help mono">执行证据 ${esc(evidence.id)}</p></details>`;return `<details class="record-details error-evidence"><summary>查看执行证据 · ${esc(statusName(result.status))}</summary><dl class="record-metadata"><div><dt>证据来源</dt><dd>${evidence.kind==='external'?'用户录入 · 未经本地核验':'本地执行记录'} · ${esc(evidence.source||'')}</dd></div><div><dt>证据时间</dt><dd>${when(evidence.created_at)}</dd></div><div><dt>执行证据 ID</dt><dd class="mono">${esc(evidence.id)}</dd></div></dl>${evidence.kind==='external'?`<p class="text-block">${esc(result.notes||'未补充说明')}</p>`:`<p class="help">程序执行：${result.executed?'已执行':'未确认执行'} · 期望比较：${result.matches_expected===true?'一致':result.matches_expected===false?'不一致':'未比较'}</p><div class="two-col"><div><p class="help">标准输入</p><pre>${esc(evidence.stdin||'（空）')}</pre></div><div><p class="help">标准输出</p><pre>${esc(result.stdout||'（空）')}</pre></div></div>${evidence.expected_output!==null&&evidence.expected_output!==undefined?`<p class="help">期望输出</p><pre>${esc(evidence.expected_output||'（空）')}</pre>`:''}${result.stderr?`<p class="help">标准错误</p><pre>${esc(result.stderr)}</pre>`:''}${result.error?`<p class="status-note error">${esc(result.error)}</p>`:''}`}</details>`;}
function errorCard(err){return `<article class="error-record" data-error-id="${esc(err.id)}"><div class="row wrap-mobile"><strong>${esc(err.reason||'尚未填写原因')}</strong><span class="badge ${['uncertain','ai_candidate'].includes(err.status)?'warn':'neutral'}">${esc(errorLabels[err.status]||err.status)}</span></div><p class="record-time">${esc(vlabel(err.version_id))}${err.version_id!==state.task.current_version_id?' · 历史代码版本':''} · 记录于 ${when(err.created_at)}${err.updated_at&&err.updated_at!==err.created_at?' · 修订于 '+when(err.updated_at):''}</p>${err.observed?`<p class="text-block"><span class="record-label">实际表现</span>${esc(err.observed)}</p>`:''}${boundErrorEvidence(err)}<details class="record-details"><summary>修订原因 · ${Number(err.revision||(err.revisions||[]).length||1)} 个版本</summary><form data-error-edit="${esc(err.id)}" data-draft id="error-edit-${esc(err.id)}">${area('实际错误表现','observed',err.observed||'','maxlength="5000" required')}${area('原因说明','reason',err.reason,'maxlength="5000" required')}${select('原因状态','status',Object.entries(errorLabels).map(([k,v])=>option(k,v,err.status)).join(''))}<button type="submit">保存原因修订</button></form><h3 class="space-top">修订时间线</h3><ol class="timeline">${(err.revisions||err.history||[]).map(r=>`<li><strong>修订 ${esc(r.revision||'')} · ${esc(errorLabels[r.status||r.after?.status]||r.status||'状态更新')}</strong><p class="text-block">${esc(r.reason||r.after?.reason||r.new_reason||'未补充原因')}</p>${r.observed?`<p class="help text-block">实际表现：${esc(r.observed)}</p>`:''}<small>${when(r.created_at)} · ${esc(vlabel(r.version_id||err.version_id))}</small></li>`).join('')||'<li>尚无历史修订。</li>'}</ol><p class="help mono">错误记录 ID：${esc(err.id)}</p></details></article>`;}
function renderErrors(){const target=document.getElementById('error-history');if(!target)return;if(Array.from(target.querySelectorAll('form[data-draft]')).some(dirtyForm))return;target.innerHTML=(state.task.errors||[]).map(errorCard).join('')||empty('还没有错误原因。先记录发生了什么，再决定原因是否确定。');target.querySelectorAll('[data-error-edit]').forEach(form=>bindForm(form.id,async(form,data)=>{const snapshot=serialize(form);await api('/api/errors/'+encodeURIComponent(form.dataset.errorEdit),'PUT',{version_id:state.task.errors.find(e=>e.id===form.dataset.errorEdit).version_id,evidence_id:state.task.errors.find(e=>e.id===form.dataset.errorEdit).evidence_id||null,observed:data.get('observed'),reason:data.get('reason'),status:data.get('status'),revision:state.task.errors.find(e=>e.id===form.dataset.errorEdit).revision});saved(form,snapshot);await refreshIntegratedTask();notify('原因修订已保存，历史记录保留。');}));target.querySelectorAll('form').forEach(form=>saved(form));}
async function refreshIntegratedTask(){const task=await api('/api/tasks/'+state.task.id);state.task.errors=task.errors||[];state.task.associations=task.associations||[];state.task.submissions=task.submissions||[];state.task.evidence=task.evidence;state.task.teaching_outputs=task.teaching_outputs;state.task.summary_versions=task.summary_versions;renderTeachingDrafts();renderSharedEvidence();renderErrors();renderSubmissions();renderEvidence();renderTaskAssociations();refreshErrorSelectors();}
function renderTaskAssociations(){const box=document.getElementById('task-associations');if(!box)return;box.innerHTML=(state.task.associations||[]).map(a=>`<article class="compact-association"><div class="row wrap-mobile"><span class="badge ${a.stale?'neutral':a.status==='pending'?'warn':'neutral'}">${esc(relationLabels[a.status]||a.status)}</span><small>${when(a.updated_at||a.created_at)}</small></div>${a.stale?'<p class="stale-note">依据已失效：原因或代码版本已变化，此关联不能再次确认。请核对当前记录后重新提出关联。</p>':''}<p class="text-block">${esc(a.rationale||a.reason||'未补充关联依据')}</p><a href="#/association/${encodeURIComponent(a.id)}">核对双方依据与决策历史 →</a></article>`).join('')||empty('尚无跨题关联。可基于两道题的错误记录手工提出待确认关联。');}

function refreshErrorSelectors(){
  const form=document.getElementById('error-form');
  if(form&&!dirtyForm(form)){
    form.elements.version_id.innerHTML=versionOptions(state.task.current_version_id);
    updateErrorEvidence();saved(form);
  }
  const linkForm=document.getElementById('association-form');
  if(linkForm&&!dirtyForm(linkForm)){
    const selected=linkForm.elements.left_error_id.value;
    linkForm.elements.left_error_id.innerHTML=(state.task.errors||[]).map(e=>option(e.id,e.reason||e.observed,selected)).join('');
    saved(linkForm);
  }
}
function updateErrorEvidence(){
  const form=document.getElementById('error-form');if(!form)return;
  const selected=form.elements.evidence_id.value;
  form.elements.evidence_id.innerHTML='<option value="">未绑定执行证据</option>'+state.task.evidence.filter(e=>e.version_id===form.elements.version_id.value).map(e=>option(e.id,vlabel(e.version_id)+' · '+statusName(e.result.status),selected)).join('');
}
function installCodeTemplate(){
  const form=document.getElementById('task-form');if(!form)return;
  form.querySelector('.actions').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<button id="insert-language-template" type="button">查看语言模板</button>');
  form.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<details id="language-template-panel"><summary>当前语言模板与运行范围</summary><p id="language-template-note" class="help"></p><pre id="language-template-code"></pre><button type="button" id="use-language-template">将模板填入空代码草稿</button></details>');
  const update=()=>{const meta=state.languages[form.elements.language.value]||{};document.getElementById('language-template-note').textContent=[meta.entry_note,meta.limitations].filter(Boolean).join(' ');document.getElementById('language-template-code').textContent=meta.template||'暂无模板';};
  form.elements.language.addEventListener('change',update);update();
  document.getElementById('insert-language-template').addEventListener('click',()=>{const panel=document.getElementById('language-template-panel');panel.open=!panel.open;});
  document.getElementById('use-language-template').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(form.elements.code.value.trim()){notify('代码已有内容。为保留你的草稿，请先复制内容或手动清空后填入模板。');return;}form.elements.code.value=state.languages[form.elements.language.value]?.template||'';form.elements.code.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));notify('模板已填入草稿，保存后产生正式代码版本。');});
}

async function mountIntegratedTask(task,epoch){const main=document.querySelector('.work-main');main.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<section class="panel task-context"><div class="row"><h2>题目详情与来源</h2>${task.source?.question_id?`<a href="#/bank/${encodeURIComponent(task.source.question_id)}">查看题库定义</a>`:''}</div><p class="text-block problem-text">${esc(task.statement)}</p><details><summary>来源、许可与内容快照</summary>${sourceSummary(task)}</details></section>`);
  const sourceDetails=document.querySelector('#task-form details');sourceDetails.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',sourceFields(task)+`<input type="hidden" name="import_status" value="${esc(task.source?.import_status||'manual')}">`);
  main.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<section class="panel" id="errors-panel"><div class="row"><h2>错误原因记录</h2><a href="#/library">打开错题库</a></div><p class="help">每条原因保留对应代码与执行证据；候选、确认和修订分别记录。</p><details class="record-entry" ${(task.errors||[]).length?'':'open'}><summary>记录新的错误原因</summary><form id="error-form" data-draft><fieldset class="form-section"><legend>代码与执行证据</legend><div class="two-col">${select('发生错误的代码版本','version_id',versionOptions(task.current_version_id))}${select('关联执行证据（可选）','evidence_id','<option value="">未绑定执行证据</option>'+task.evidence.map(e=>option(e.id,vlabel(e.version_id)+' · '+statusName(e.result.status),'')).join(''))}</div></fieldset><fieldset class="form-section"><legend>实际表现与原因判断</legend>${area('实际错误表现','observed','','required maxlength="5000" placeholder="例如 输入 3 时实际输出 3，公开样例预期 6"')}${area('原因说明','reason','','required maxlength="5000" placeholder="例如 循环上界遗漏最后一个元素"')}${select('原因状态','status',Object.entries(errorLabels).map(([k,v])=>option(k,v,'uncertain')).join(''))}</fieldset><button class="primary" type="submit">保存错误原因</button><p class="help space-top">保存原因不会自动确认，也不会替代错题笔记。</p></form></details><div id="error-history" class="error-records"></div></section><section class="panel" id="associations-panel"><h2>跨题目错误关联</h2><p class="help">关联基于两条错误记录。用户决策与双方原因的确认状态独立保存。</p><div id="task-associations"></div><details><summary>手工提出关联</summary><form id="association-form" data-draft>${select('本题错误记录','left_error_id',(task.errors||[]).map(e=>option(e.id,e.reason,e.id)).join(''))}${field('另一题错误记录 ID','right_error_id','','required maxlength="64" placeholder="从另一题的错误原因记录复制"')}${area('关联依据','rationale','','required maxlength="5000" placeholder="哪些执行表现和错误机制支持这条关联？"')}<button type="submit">提出待确认关联</button></form></details></section><details class="panel"><summary>本题学习偏好 · 可覆盖全局设置</summary><div id="task-preferences"></div></details>`);
  if(task.source?.question_id){const run=document.getElementById('run-form');run.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',`<div class="bank-run-controls"><h3>题库测试</h3><p class="help">公开样例可查看输入输出；正式测试独立执行，隐藏内容不向页面提供。结果绑定当前已保存版本。</p><div class="actions"><button id="sample-tests" type="button">运行公开样例</button><button id="submit-tests" type="button" class="primary">提交正式测试</button></div><div id="submission-list"></div></div>`);for(const [id,mode] of [['sample-tests','samples'],['submit-tests','submit']])document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('click',()=>action(document.querySelector('.bank-run-controls'),async()=>{requireSaved();const version=state.task.current_version_id;const key=`alpha-bank-request:${state.task.id}:${mode}:${version}`;let requestId;try{requestId=sessionStorage.getItem(key);}catch(_){}requestId=requestId||crypto.randomUUID();sessionStorage.setItem(key,requestId);const result=await api(`/api/tasks/${state.task.id}/${mode}`,'POST',{version_id:version,request_id:requestId});sessionStorage.removeItem(key);await refreshIntegratedTask();notify(`测试记录已保存：${result.passed||0} / ${result.total||0} 项一致。`);}));renderSubmissions();}
  document.getElementById('error-form').elements.version_id.addEventListener('change',updateErrorEvidence);updateErrorEvidence();installCodeTemplate();
  bindForm('error-form',async(form,data)=>{const snapshot=serialize(form);await api(`/api/tasks/${state.task.id}/errors`,'POST',{version_id:data.get('version_id'),evidence_id:data.get('evidence_id')||null,observed:data.get('observed'),reason:data.get('reason'),status:data.get('status')});saved(form,snapshot);if(serialize(form)===snapshot){form.elements.reason.value='';form.elements.observed.value='';saved(form);}await refreshIntegratedTask();notify('错误原因已保存。');});
  bindForm('association-form',async(form,data)=>{const snapshot=serialize(form);const relation=await api('/api/associations','POST',Object.fromEntries(data));saved(form,snapshot);go('#/association/'+encodeURIComponent(relation.id));});renderErrors();renderTaskAssociations();refreshErrorSelectors();await mountPreferences(epoch,task.id);if(epoch!==state.epoch)return;watchForms();
}
async function associationPage(id,epoch){const relation=await api('/api/associations/'+encodeURIComponent(id));if(epoch!==state.epoch)return;const raw=relation.association||relation;const basis=raw.basis_snapshot||{};const left=relation.left_error||relation.left||raw.left_error||basis[0]||basis.a||basis.left||basis.error_a;const right=relation.right_error||relation.right||raw.right_error||basis[1]||basis.b||basis.right||basis.error_b;
  const side=(record,label)=>`<section class="association-basis"><p class="eyebrow">${label} · 建立时的记录快照</p>${record?`<h3>${esc(record.task_title||record.title||record.reason||record.error?.reason||'错误原因')}</h3><span class="badge ${['uncertain','ai_candidate'].includes(record.status||record.error?.status)?'warn':'neutral'}">${esc(errorLabels[record.status||record.error?.status]||'尚未确定')}</span>${record.observed?`<p class="text-block space-top"><span class="record-label">实际表现</span>${esc(record.observed)}</p>`:''}<dl class="record-metadata"><div><dt>原因</dt><dd class="text-block">${esc(record.reason||record.error?.reason||'未补充原因')}</dd></div><div><dt>原因修订</dt><dd>${esc(record.revision||'未提供')}</dd></div><div><dt>错误记录</dt><dd class="mono">${esc(record.id||record.error?.id)}</dd></div><div><dt>代码版本</dt><dd class="mono">${esc(record.version_id||record.error?.version_id||'未提供')}</dd></div><div><dt>执行证据</dt><dd class="mono">${esc(record.evidence_id||record.error?.evidence_id||'未绑定')}</dd></div></dl><a href="${taskUrl(record.task_id||record.error?.task_id)}">核对当前题目、代码与证据 →</a>`:'<p>错误记录标识：'+esc(label==='左侧错误'?raw.left_error_id||raw.error_a_id:raw.right_error_id||raw.error_b_id)+'</p>'}</section>`;
  app.innerHTML=`<div class="page-heading row"><div><p class="eyebrow">跨题错误关联</p><h1>核对关联依据</h1><p class="muted">比较错误表现与原因，再记录你的决定。</p></div><a href="#/library">返回错题库</a></div><section class="panel association-review"><div class="row wrap-mobile"><h2>关联判断</h2><span id="association-status" class="badge ${raw.status==='pending'?'warn':'neutral'}" role="status">${esc(relationLabels[raw.status]||raw.status)}</span></div>${raw.stale?'<p class="status-note stale-note">依据已失效：关联建立后，原因或代码版本已变化。此关联不能再次确认；请核对当前记录，再从题目工作区提出新的关联。历史决策仍保留。</p>':''}<p class="text-block">${esc(raw.rationale||raw.reason||'尚未补充关联依据')}</p><p class="help">建立于 ${when(raw.created_at)} · 更新于 ${when(raw.updated_at)}。确认关联不会确认双方错误原因。</p><div class="actions">${['confirmed','rejected','ignored','revoked'].map(k=>`<button type="button" data-relation-status="${k}" ${k==='confirmed'?'class="primary"':''} ${raw.stale&&k==='confirmed'?'disabled title="依据已失效，请重新建立关联"':''}>${relationLabels[k]}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="evidence-pair">${side(left,'左侧错误')}${side(right,'右侧错误')}</div><div class="association-decisions"><h2>用户决策时间线</h2><ol class="timeline">${(relation.history||raw.history||[]).map(h=>`<li><strong>${h.from_status?esc(relationLabels[h.from_status]||h.from_status)+' → ':''}${esc(relationLabels[h.status||h.to_status||h.to]||h.status||h.action||'状态变更')}</strong><small>${when(h.created_at||h.at)}</small></li>`).join('')||'<li>待用户核对。</li>'}</ol></div></section>`;
  app.querySelectorAll('[data-relation-status]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>action(button.closest('section'),async()=>{await api('/api/associations/'+encodeURIComponent(id),'PATCH',{status:button.dataset.relationStatus});await associationPage(id,epoch);notify('关联决策已保存。');})));
}
